{"id":"enfermedad","lemma":"enfermedad","pos":"noun","rank":1037,"glosses":["illness, disease"],"ipa":"/enfeɾmeˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"enfermedades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-enfermedad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una enfermedad incurable.","en":"It's an incurable disease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567498"},{"text":"No todas las enfermedades infecciosas son contagiosas.","en":"Not all the infectious diseases are contagious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691538"},{"text":"Esa enfermedad es incurable.","en":"That disease is incurable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585711"},{"text":"La vacunación ayuda a prevenir las enfermedades infantiles.","en":"Vaccinations help prevent childhood diseases.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189473"},{"text":"Él murió de esa enfermedad.","en":"He died of that disease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70180"}]}